<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-savory-brunch-ideas">Savory Brunch Ideas</h2>



<p>Savory dishes are the anchors of a brunch menu. They are the ones guests fill their plates with first, the ones that hold the spread together while the parfaits, muffins, and small bites do their work around them.</p>



<p>The brunch recipes below are the savory mains I make most often when I am hosting weekend brunch, whether it is a small Sunday gathering on the deck or a bigger group for a holiday brunch. Most of them prep ahead beautifully, so you can pour mimosas instead of standing at the stove.</p>


